                  <div class="text-m paragraph-spacing-10">
          <p>The Endover team is at the heart of the Volta SKAI development – people whose work begins long before construction and continues long after life in the building is already underway. Our team combines long-term experience, thorough planning expertise, and a strong sense of space to ensure that every decision serves the whole: a strong urban environment, lasting value, and a well-functioning home.</p>
<p>As a developer, we are a co-creator, coordinator, and partner both within the collaboration network and for the client. For us, a home is not merely an object, but an environment with meaning. Creating such a space requires people who see the bigger picture and care about every detail.</p>

